---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="About | OpenHearth">
  <main class="about-page">
    <div class="container">

      <header class="page-header reveal d1">
        <p class="page-eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>What OpenHearth stands for</h1>
      </header>

      <div class="prose">
        <section class="prose-section manifesto reveal d2">
          <h2>What OpenHearth stands for.</h2>
          <p>We are for young, big families: the households where the next generation is actually born, raised, and formed.</p>
          <p>We are against a policy class with no stake in the future it legislates.</p>
          <p>We are for the covenant of one man and one woman, ordered to children, permanent by design.</p>
          <p>We are against the state's redefinition of marriage, and against the catechism that calls principled disagreement a hatred.</p>
          <p>We are for private property and the fruits of honest labor.</p>
          <p>We are against Rainbow Maoism: the reallocation of a family's wages by race, grievance, and sexual politics dressed in the language of liberation. Your work, your wages, your household. Yours.</p>
          <p>We are for thick community: the parish, the block, the table set for ten, the neighbors who know your children's names.</p>
          <p>We are against the commune, the cult, and every utopia that swallows the household to feed itself.</p>
          <p>We are for friendships forged in presence: shared work, shared meals, shared burdens, shared decades.</p>
          <p>We are against the counterfeit intimacy of the feed, and the loneliness it sells as connection.</p>
          <p>We are for present parents as the first and final authority over their children's formation.</p>
          <p>We are against the public school monopoly, the unions that shield educator misconduct at rates exceeding the clergy scandals a generation was taught to revile, and the activists, surgeons, and prescribers profiting from manufactured doubt about children's own bodies.</p>
          <p>We are for peace: peace in the heart, peace at the hearth, peace in the home.</p>
          <p>We are against every institution that has declared the ordinary family a site of oppression rather than the foundation of a free people.</p>
          <p>We are for Christlike love made concrete in neighborhoods, parishes, and local governments small enough to know a family's name.</p>
          <p>We are against the distant, the childless, and the contemptuous, wherever they sit and whatever they call themselves.</p>
        </section>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Base>

<style>
  .about-page {
    padding-top: 100px; /* clear fixed nav */
    padding-bottom: 96px;
    min-height: 100vh;
    background: var(--bg);
  }

  /* ── Page header ── */
  .page-header {
    padding: 56px 0 48px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 56px;
  }
  .page-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1.4px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .page-header h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .status-line {
    display: inline-block;
    max-width: 720px;
    padding: 10px 16px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    background: var(--bg-tinted);
    border-radius: 0 var(--oh-r-md) var(--oh-r-md) 0;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-sec);
  }

  /* ── Prose layout ── */
  .prose {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .prose-section h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }
  .prose-section p {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-sec);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .prose-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-top: 88px;
      padding-bottom: 72px;
    }
    .page-header {
      padding: 40px 0 36px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .about-page {
      padding-top: 76px;
      padding-bottom: 56px;
    }
    .page-header {
      padding: 32px 0 28px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .prose-section h2 {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
  }

  /* ── Reduced motion ── */
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .reveal {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
